bmatrix}0.0\\\\\nL461: 0.05\\\\\nL462: -0.1\\end{bmatrix},$  |  | (67)\nL463:  | $\\displaystyle W_{3}$  | $\\displaystyle=\\begin{bmatrix}1.0&-0.5&0.3\\\\\nL533: Numerical examples on a small $1$–$2$–$2$–$1$ network with SwiGLU activation and a $2$–$3$–$3$–$2$ network with GELU activation demonstrated that, even in these simple settings, the framework identifies a low-dimensional set of hidden units and directions that carry most of the input–output behavior near the operating point.\n"
